<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<style>
  /*
    Preliminary Acceptance Certificate — geometry taken from
    241-00-102R11_PAC.pdf. Outer frame 50.4pt..516.6pt x 54pt..551.8pt.
  */
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    width: 595.32pt; height: 841.92pt; position: relative;
    font-family: Tahoma, "DejaVu Sans", Verdana, sans-serif;
    font-size: 5.2pt; color: #000; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
  }
  .ar {
    direction: rtl;
    font-family: Tahoma, "Noto Naskh Arabic", "Noto Sans Arabic", Amiri, "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
  }
  .abs { position: absolute; }

  .banner {
    left: 0; width: 595.32pt; text-align: center;
    font-family: Aptos, Calibri, "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: 4.7pt; color: #F59042;
  }

  .frame {
    left: 50.4pt; top: 54pt; width: 466.2pt; height: 497.8pt;
    border: 1pt solid #000;
  }

  table { border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; }
  td, th { padding: 0; margin: 0; vertical-align: middle; }

  .logo-wrap { left: 50.4pt; top: 54pt; width: 466.2pt; height: 33.4pt; text-align: center; }
  .logo-wrap img { height: 22pt; margin-top: 1pt; }

  /* --- title band --- */
  .title { left: 51.4pt; top: 87.4pt; width: 464.2pt; height: 9.6pt; }
  .title td {
    background: #D9D9D9; border-top: 1pt solid #000; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000;
    text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 7.6pt; line-height: 9.2pt;
  }
  .title td.l { border-right: 1pt solid #000; width: 218.3pt; }

  /* --- clause body --- */
  .clause { left: 51.4pt; top: 97.2pt; width: 464.2pt; height: 102.4pt; }
  .clause td { vertical-align: top; font-size: 6.1pt; line-height: 7.8pt; padding: 6pt 4pt 0 4pt; }
  .clause td.l { border-right: 1pt solid #000; width: 218.3pt; }
  .clause .lead-in { margin-bottom: 8pt; }
  .clause p { margin: 0 0 7pt 0; }
  .ref { color: #0563C1; }

  /* --- project info rows --- */
  .info { left: 50.9pt; top: 200.1pt; width: 465.3pt; }
  .info td {
    border: 1pt solid #000; height: 14.05pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 5.2pt;
  }
  .info td.k { width: 71.8pt; padding-left: 1.8pt; }
  .info td.v { width: 239.3pt; text-align: center; }
  .info td.a { text-align: right; padding-right: 2pt; }

  /* --- site grid --- */
  .sites { left: 50.9pt; top: 242.5pt; width: 465.3pt; }
  .sites th {
    background: #D9D9D9; border: 1pt solid #000; height: 13.7pt;
    font-weight: bold; font-size: 5.2pt; text-align: center;
  }
  .sites td {
    border: .5pt solid #000; border-left: 1pt solid #000; border-right: 1pt solid #000;
    height: 14.97pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 5.2pt;
    overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sites tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 1pt solid #000; }

  /* --- signature block --- */
  .sigh { left: 50.9pt; top: 466.7pt; width: 465.3pt; }
  .sigh td {
    background: #D9D9D9; border: 1pt solid #000; height: 16.7pt;
    text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 5.2pt;
    /* Matches .sigb so the two blocks line up column for column. */
    width: 50%;
  }
  /* The contractor already signed the GCL this certificate follows from, so
     that signature is carried across. */
  .sigb .sigcell { position: relative; height: 30pt; }
  .sigb .sig { position: absolute; left: 34pt; top: 2pt; height: 22pt; }

  .sigb { left: 50.9pt; top: 483.4pt; width: 465.3pt; }
  .sigb td {
    border-bottom: .5pt solid #000; border-left: 1pt solid #000; border-right: 1pt solid #000;
    height: 16.88pt; font-size: 5.2pt; padding-left: 1.2pt;
    /*
     * Half each. Two cells fixed at 242pt came to 484pt in a 465.3pt table, so
     * the right-hand one hung 18.7pt past the edge — the stray box beside the
     * Tawal column.
     */
    width: 50%;
  }
  .sigb tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 1pt solid #000; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="abs frame"></div>

  <div class="abs logo-wrap">
    {{#if logoTawal}}<img src="{{logoTawal}}" alt="TAWAL" />{{/if}}
  </div>

  <table class="abs title">
    <tr>
      <td class="l">Preliminary Acceptance Certificate</td>
      <td class="ar">شهادة استلام ابتدائية</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table class="abs clause">
    <tr>
      <td class="l">
        <p class="lead-in">
          Save the defects, malfunctions and bugs stated herein above/ PAT, TAWAL
          subject to <span class="ref">clause 7</span> of the Agreement hereby certifies that:
        </p>
        <p>&bull;&#9;The rest of the Products and/or Services described in the above Agreement
          and the respective Work Order have been delivered, provided and completed by the
          Supplier after the inspection and testing conducted by TAWAL from the RFA date
          until the PAT Period End Date.</p>
        <p>&bull;&#9;The FAC will not be issued until the above defects, malfunctions and bugs
          are rectified within the Rectification Period stated hereinabove.</p>
      </td>
      <td class="ar">
        <p class="lead-in">بالاشارة الى العيوب والأعطال والأخطاء المذكورة أعلاه او في PAT الاستلام
          المبدئي ، واستنادا <span class="ref">للبند 7</span> من الاتفاقية فإن توال تصادق على ما يلي:</p>
        <p>&bull; بقية المنتجات و / أو الخدمات الموضحة في الاتفاقية أعلاه وأمر العمل المعني قد تم
          تسليمها وتقديمها وإكمالها من قبل المقاول بعد الفحص والاختبار الذي أجرته توال من تاريخ
          RFA حتى تاريخ انتهاء فترة PAT.</p>
        <p>&bull; لن يتم إصدار FAC حتى يتم تصحيح العيوب والأعطال والأخطاء المذكورة أعلاه خلال
          فترة التصحيح.</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table class="abs info">
    <tr>
      <td class="k">Project Name :</td>
      <td class="v">{{projectName}}</td>
      <td class="a ar">اسم المشروع :</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="k">Contractor Name :</td>
      <td class="v">{{contractorName}}</td>
      <td class="a ar">اسم المقاول :</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="k">P.O No. :</td>
      <td class="v">{{poNumber}}</td>
      <td class="a ar">رقم أمر الشراء:</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table class="abs sites">
    <colgroup>
      <col style="width:71.8pt" /><col style="width:44.6pt" />
      <col style="width:46.2pt" /><col style="width:302.7pt" />
    </colgroup>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Site ID</th><th>Region</th><th>District</th><th>WO Number</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {{#each rows}}
      <tr>
        <td>{{this.siteId}}</td>
        <td>{{this.region}}</td>
        <td>{{this.district}}</td>
        <td>{{this.woNumber}}</td>
      </tr>
      {{/each}}
      {{#padRows rows tableRows}}
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      {{/padRows}}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table class="abs sigh">
    <tr>
      <td>Contractor Project Manager</td>
      <td>Tawal Project Manager</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table class="abs sigb">
    {{!-- Same four rows as the Tawal side: Name, ID, Sign, Date. --}}
    <tr>
      <td>Name : {{contractorPmName}}</td>
      <td>Name : {{tawalPmName}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>ID: {{contractorPmId}}</td>
      <td>ID: {{tawalPmId}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="sigcell">
        Sign :
        {{!-- Signature only. The stamp belongs on the GCL, not the certificate. --}}
        {{#if signature}}<img class="sig" src="{{signature}}" alt="" />{{/if}}
      </td>
      <td>Sign :</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      {{!-- The label always prints; only the value is conditional, so an
            unknown date reads as an empty field rather than a missing row. --}}
      <td>Date : {{#if pacDate}}{{slashDate pacDate}}{{/if}}</td>
      <td>Date :</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
